  <section class="py-12 my-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-dark-text mb-8">What Our Cabinet Refacing Clients Say</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-light rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“Refaced our 1990s oak cabinets in Fremont with white shaker doors and brushed nickel Amerock pulls. The kitchen looks completely new and we saved thousands compared to replacing everything. Done in four days.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Karen W.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">3 months ago</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“Great recommendation to pair refacing with new Caesarstone countertops in our Green Lake home. The whole kitchen transformation took under two weeks and cost less than half what full replacement was quoted at.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Tom R.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">2 months ago</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-light rounded-xl border border-border p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mb-3"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-lg">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></div>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">“The flat-panel gray laminate doors they installed in our Columbia City townhouse gave it a modern look we love. Soft-close hinges on everything. Really impressed with the quality.”</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-dark-text">Angela S.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">5 months ago</p>
